<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Sonic Corp cut to hold.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Sonic Corp cut to hold.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Stephens Inc said it downgraded Sonic Corp to hold from strong buy.</p>
<p>-- Sonic said earlier Monday that it expects its second quarter earnings to fall short of analysts' estimates.</p>
<p>-- Stephens said it expects it will take several quarters for Sonic to regain an earnings per share multiple &quot;commensurate with its growth.&quot;</p>
</text>
